# Chub AI business read API and image resources.
# https://docs.chub.ai/docs/the-basics/getting-started

# The frontend GETs notifications and community event/nomination data here.
# Repeated valid /api/events responses with browser Origin/Referer favor direct.
DOMAIN,ro.chub.ai

# Avatar, character-card and image resource host.
# Default-avatar and PNG transfers were stable on the direct path; favicon
# samples favored proxies, so this is not a claim that every object is faster.
DOMAIN,avatars.charhub.io
